WEBVTT

00:10.960 --> 00:12.710
<b>This is how I'll become...</b>

00:15.710 --> 00:17.460
<b>This is how I'll become...</b>

00:19.580 --> 00:21.250
<b>...Supreme Commander.</b>

00:21.630 --> 00:22.750
<b>...a hero.</b>

00:23.380 --> 00:25.000
<b>This is my story!</b>

01:56.630 --> 02:00.330
<b>Encounter, Kyouka, Rampage</b>

02:06.290 --> 02:07.500
<b>Welcome, ma'am!</b>

02:07.500 --> 02:08.460
<b>Thanks.</b>

02:10.080 --> 02:10.920
<b>Yuuki.</b>

02:10.920 --> 02:13.540
<b>I'm going to take care of the paperwork.
Wait for me outside.</b>

02:13.540 --> 02:15.040
<b>Sure.</b>

02:16.460 --> 02:20.790
<b>So, the 5th Squad's gateway is connected
all the way to Yamagata, huh?</b>

02:17.830 --> 02:20.750
<b>Yamagata</b>

02:17.830 --> 02:20.750
<b>Passage</b>

02:20.790 --> 02:23.170
<b>It only took us a 20 minute
drive on the other side.</b>

02:21.920 --> 02:23.540
<b>DEMON DEFENSE FORCE</b>

02:21.920 --> 02:23.540
<b>5TH SQUADRON DORM</b>

02:23.170 --> 02:24.750
<b>Interdimensional travel is nuts!</b>

02:23.540 --> 02:24.710
<b>INNER GATEWAY</b>

02:25.420 --> 02:26.630
<b>Thanks for waiting.</b>

02:33.670 --> 02:34.710
<b>What's the matter?</b>

02:36.460 --> 02:39.420
<b>Oh! It's just nice to be back
in our home world, ya know!</b>

02:40.790 --> 02:43.750
<b>We'd all burn out
without a break from work.</b>

02:43.750 --> 02:47.420
<b>But time off is in short supply.
Enjoy the fresh air while you can.</b>

02:47.420 --> 02:48.380
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

02:51.130 --> 02:55.500
<b>She's awfully pretty,
now that I take a good look.</b>

02:56.500 --> 02:58.000
<b>Look ahead when you walk.</b>

02:58.000 --> 02:59.210
<b>S-sorry about that!</b>

02:59.210 --> 03:02.580
<b>U-um... may I ask where we're going?</b>

03:11.040 --> 03:12.500
<b>Yuuki?</b>

03:12.710 --> 03:14.210
<b>Yuuki!</b>

03:15.170 --> 03:16.920
<b>Have you seen Yuuki anywhere?</b>

03:16.920 --> 03:19.880
<b>Yuuki went out with the Commander earlier.</b>

03:19.880 --> 03:21.290
<b>He did?</b>

03:21.290 --> 03:22.080
<b>Yep!</b>

03:22.080 --> 03:26.630
<b>Himari took them to the Yamagata Passage
while out on her regular patrol.</b>

03:26.630 --> 03:29.330
<b>Oh, right.</b>

03:29.330 --> 03:30.790
<b>Today is...</b>

03:29.330 --> 03:31.750
<b>May 11th</b>

03:35.250 --> 03:38.000
<b>There was an incident
at Mount Gassan in Oisawa</b>

03:35.250 --> 03:37.710
<b>Mato Mishap</b>

03:35.250 --> 03:37.710
<b>Memorial Monument</b>

03:38.000 --> 03:40.210
<b>where dozens of Shuuki
wandered into this world.</b>

03:40.630 --> 03:43.170
<b>And one of them was especially powerful.</b>

03:43.790 --> 03:46.040
<b>I remember it as clear as day.</b>

03:50.460 --> 03:53.920
<b>It had a single horn
that really stuck out.</b>

03:55.130 --> 03:59.000
<b>So I call it... the "Unihorn."</b>

04:00.830 --> 04:03.130
<b>All of the Shuuki
that crossed over that day</b>

04:03.130 --> 04:06.330
<b>were wiped out by the
Demon Defense Force who arrived to help.</b>

04:06.330 --> 04:08.000
<b>Or so I thought.</b>

04:08.000 --> 04:10.290
<b>But after looking through the records,</b>

04:10.290 --> 04:14.750
<b>I discovered the Unihorn alone managed to
escape back through the gateway into Mato.</b>

04:14.920 --> 04:17.250
<b>So the Unihorn is still alive...</b>

04:17.920 --> 04:21.040
<b>I have a score to settle
with that damn Shuuki.</b>

04:21.880 --> 04:24.670
<b>I swear I'm gonna
make mincemeat out of it!</b>

04:24.670 --> 04:28.170
<b>And I want you to be prepared
for when that day comes, Yuuki.</b>

04:28.750 --> 04:31.040
<b>That's what I brought you here
to talk about.</b>

04:31.750 --> 04:34.420
<b>I will avenge everyone who died.</b>

04:43.540 --> 04:45.540
<b>Time for us to go back to Mato.</b>

04:45.880 --> 04:47.460
<b>Wait, Miss Kyouka!</b>

04:47.920 --> 04:49.580
<b>Can we take a break first?</b>

04:49.580 --> 04:53.290
<b>I did a little research, and it turns out
this cafe is famous for its parfaits!</b>

04:53.830 --> 04:55.670
<b>But Mato is more important...</b>

04:55.670 --> 04:57.170
<b>Check it out!</b>

04:57.170 --> 05:00.130
<b>Doesn't this parfait just look amazing?!</b>

05:01.670 --> 05:03.710
<b>Fine. But make it short.</b>

05:05.710 --> 05:07.920
<b>You're more assertive than
I gave you credit for.</b>

05:07.920 --> 05:09.670
<b>It's surprising.</b>

05:09.670 --> 05:12.710
<b>Well, you enjoy sweet treats, don't you?</b>

05:12.960 --> 05:15.710
<b>I'm just more concerned about Mato.</b>

05:15.960 --> 05:19.380
<b>I lost my big sister
in a Mato Mishap, too.</b>

05:19.790 --> 05:22.420
<b>So I know how you must feel.</b>

05:24.250 --> 05:25.290
<b>But listen,</b>

05:25.290 --> 05:28.670
<b>you'll miss your chance at vengeance
if you run yourself ragged first.</b>

05:30.040 --> 05:32.380
<b>"We'd all burn out
without a break from work."</b>

05:32.630 --> 05:33.790
<b>Remember?</b>

05:34.130 --> 05:37.630
<b>Persuasion is
another forte of yours, I see.</b>

05:37.630 --> 05:38.960
<b>Here is your order.</b>

05:39.920 --> 05:42.580
<b>Let's see how good this parfait really is.</b>

05:45.540 --> 05:47.920
<b>Yum! It's fantastic!</b>

05:49.790 --> 05:50.830
<b>What's wrong?</b>

05:50.830 --> 05:53.670
<b>Oh, nothing!
Just caught up in my own thoughts.</b>

05:57.380 --> 05:58.170
<b>Delish.</b>

05:58.830 --> 06:01.630
<b>Seeing a smile on Miss Kyouka's face
for the first time</b>

06:01.630 --> 06:04.580
<b>actually brought back memories
of my sister.</b>

06:04.580 --> 06:06.790
<b>Wow! It's delicious!</b>

06:06.790 --> 06:10.750
<b>I took your suggestion from yesterday
and added a little bit of yuzu citrus.</b>

06:10.750 --> 06:13.920
<b>You're such a smart cookie!
I give it one million thumbs up!</b>

06:13.920 --> 06:16.000
<b>Don't squeeze so tight, Sis!</b>

06:16.960 --> 06:19.670
<b>Keep up the hard work, Yuuki!</b>

06:19.670 --> 06:21.920
<b>Boys are defined by their skills
in the kitchen!</b>

06:25.580 --> 06:26.630
<b>Aren't you going to eat?</b>

06:29.420 --> 06:30.500
<b>It's delicious!</b>

06:30.500 --> 06:33.040
<b>The parfaits here
really are as good as they say!</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:33.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:36.330 --> 06:37.250
<b>A conch shell horn?</b>

06:37.250 --> 06:39.330
<b>It's an emergency call from Mato.</b>

06:39.330 --> 06:42.500
<b>A single blow of the conch shell
means it's not life threatening...</b>

06:43.380 --> 06:45.960
<b>but something serious
is happening nonetheless!</b>

06:46.130 --> 06:47.790
<b>Break time is over!</b>

06:48.040 --> 06:49.330
<b>We need to hurry back!</b>

06:50.290 --> 06:51.380
<b>We're gonna do that here?!</b>

07:06.290 --> 07:07.540
<b>That wiped me out...</b>

07:07.540 --> 07:09.670
<b>We made it back in no time flat.</b>

07:09.670 --> 07:10.670
<b>Nice job.</b>

07:10.670 --> 07:11.960
<b>I'm going to get changed.</b>

07:11.960 --> 07:13.000
<b>Okay.</b>

07:17.460 --> 07:18.960
<b>Come with me.</b>

07:18.960 --> 07:19.790
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:23.080 --> 07:24.630
<b>So, uh...</b>

07:26.130 --> 07:28.290
<b>Help me take these off.</b>

07:29.540 --> 07:32.290
<b>I-is this my reward from your ability?</b>

07:32.290 --> 07:34.380
<b>What the hell else could it possibly be?!</b>

07:34.380 --> 07:36.250
<b>Y-yeah, good point!</b>

07:36.750 --> 07:37.710
<b>Hurry it up.</b>

07:37.710 --> 07:38.580
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

07:39.830 --> 07:43.000
<b>Holy crap.
We're deep in fetish territory.</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:46.630
<b>Does that mean I'm wishing for
this kind of stuff subconsciously?!</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:51.080
<b>It's exactly what you think.</b>

07:58.460 --> 08:00.460
<b>You damn perv.</b>

08:01.500 --> 08:03.540
<b>Welcome back, you two!</b>

08:03.880 --> 08:04.920
<b>Give me the sitrep.</b>

08:05.540 --> 08:07.830
<b>There was a discovery made
during today's patrols.</b>

08:07.830 --> 08:11.880
<b>A crater-like formation appeared
about 21 kilometers to the south.</b>

08:11.880 --> 08:13.830
<b>Along with a large number of Shuuki.</b>

08:13.830 --> 08:16.880
<b>Hold up, are all of those red dots
supposed to be Shuuki?!</b>

08:16.880 --> 08:18.170
<b>A crater?</b>

08:18.170 --> 08:20.380
<b>We've never seen
anything like that before.</b>

08:20.670 --> 08:23.290
<b>They're not making any moves
to leave that area.</b>

08:23.290 --> 08:25.080
<b>It's almost like a nest of some kind.</b>

08:26.130 --> 08:28.460
<b>I'm sorry for having
to ruin your precious day off.</b>

08:28.460 --> 08:30.580
<b>That's okay. Good work.</b>

08:30.580 --> 08:32.460
<b>This problem needs our attention.</b>

08:32.460 --> 08:35.290
<b>Wiping them out will be a huge undertaking
for the 7th Squad.</b>

08:35.460 --> 08:36.580
<b>Hell yeah!</b>

08:36.580 --> 08:38.250
<b>Let's smash them all like bugs!</b>

08:38.250 --> 08:40.250
<b>Whoa! Someone's fired up!</b>

08:41.580 --> 08:43.130
<b>Get ready to move out.</b>

08:43.130 --> 08:44.830
<b>We'll ride in three vehicles.</b>

08:45.170 --> 08:46.040
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

08:50.040 --> 08:52.420
<b>I count as the third vehicle?!</b>

08:52.420 --> 08:53.540
<b>We're going on ahead!</b>

08:53.540 --> 08:54.420
<b>Yuuki!</b>

08:59.330 --> 09:00.500
<b>Talk about fast!</b>

09:00.830 --> 09:03.040
<b>He's just a wild animal.</b>

09:06.830 --> 09:09.670
<b>It would be horrific
if any people got stuck here.</b>

09:09.670 --> 09:11.210
<b>Let's clear them out!</b>

09:11.210 --> 09:12.710
<b>Don't rush it.</b>

09:12.710 --> 09:14.500
<b>Wait for my signal.</b>

09:14.830 --> 09:18.170
<b>We'll use the 7th Squad's perfect teamwork
to eliminate the entire swarm of them.</b>

09:21.290 --> 09:22.960
<b>Here goes!</b>

09:23.420 --> 09:24.540
<b>Himari!</b>

09:24.750 --> 09:25.750
<b>I'm on it!</b>

09:30.460 --> 09:33.670
<b>If they merge, it will be easier
than taking them down one by one.</b>

09:33.670 --> 09:37.080
<b>That's our time to shine!
We'll crush the big one and call it a day!</b>

09:37.080 --> 09:40.830
<b>The Shuuki are tough bastards,
but their fighting style is simplistic.</b>

09:40.830 --> 09:43.830
<b>It's impossible for us to lose
with this strategy.</b>

09:44.210 --> 09:46.580
<b>We'll destroy them
once they've reached peak size.</b>

09:46.580 --> 09:48.630
<b>Be ready to jump into battle at any time!</b>

09:48.630 --> 09:49.580
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

09:51.040 --> 09:52.250
<b>Miss Kyouka!</b>

09:52.250 --> 09:53.080
<b>Shushu!</b>

09:58.250 --> 09:59.080
<b>Shushu!</b>

10:03.960 --> 10:06.670
<b>One horn... that's really long...</b>

10:08.250 --> 10:09.630
<b>It's him!</b>

10:13.960 --> 10:14.540
<b>Dammit!</b>

10:21.790 --> 10:24.170
<b>I'm here to join the party.</b>

10:24.380 --> 10:25.420
<b>It talks?!</b>

10:25.420 --> 10:27.500
<b>What are you? A monster?!</b>

10:27.830 --> 10:30.330
<b>Now that's not very nice.</b>

10:30.330 --> 10:31.960
<b>Be careful...</b>

10:31.960 --> 10:34.130
<b>because I have more
than just a sharp tongue!</b>

10:38.790 --> 10:39.630
<b>Himari!</b>

10:48.500 --> 10:50.170
<b>That felt good!</b>

10:54.420 --> 10:56.670
<b>Well, now. Aren't we a tough one?</b>

10:57.040 --> 10:58.790
<b>I've finally found you...</b>

10:58.960 --> 11:00.380
<b>Unihorn!</b>

11:00.920 --> 11:04.040
<b>Oh? Sounds like they have
a nickname for you!</b>

11:04.460 --> 11:07.830
<b>That's the bastard who destroyed
Miss Kyouka's hometown!</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:14.790
<b>You, on the Shuuki! Who are you?!</b>

11:15.210 --> 11:16.880
<b>I guess you could say...</b>

11:16.880 --> 11:19.750
<b>I'm the Demon Defense Force's archenemy.</b>

11:19.750 --> 11:21.290
<b>A Mato Peach?!</b>

11:21.290 --> 11:24.750
<b>By the way, have you seen
my little brother anywhere?</b>

11:25.880 --> 11:30.580
<b>He's easy to spot, seeing as how
he's the most handsome man ever.</b>

11:36.040 --> 11:37.790
<b>Little brother?</b>

11:38.080 --> 11:40.250
<b>There are more of these things?</b>

11:51.630 --> 11:54.460
<b>My little brother was
obsessed with me, you see.</b>

11:54.460 --> 11:58.130
<b>He was always following me
around when we were young!</b>

11:59.000 --> 12:01.830
<b>In spite of that,
the instant he got a bit older,</b>

12:01.830 --> 12:03.250
<b>he turned into such a rascal!</b>

12:05.580 --> 12:07.420
<b>But those were fun days for me,</b>

12:07.420 --> 12:09.710
<b>because I got to knock
some manners into him!</b>

12:09.920 --> 12:12.460
<b>It can talk?! Is it a Shuuki?</b>

12:12.460 --> 12:14.330
<b>Whatever, all that matters right now</b>

12:14.330 --> 12:16.500
<b>is that this one's clearly different
from the rest!</b>

12:16.960 --> 12:18.540
<b>My little brother's name is...</b>

12:27.790 --> 12:32.670
<b>I'm talking to them about my brother,
so don't get in the damn way!</b>

12:35.330 --> 12:36.500
<b>Have a snack.</b>

12:39.420 --> 12:40.790
<b>I get it...</b>

12:41.920 --> 12:43.710
<b>you must be their Supreme Commander!</b>

12:44.580 --> 12:48.080
<b>You just don't know anything
about Mato, huh?</b>

12:54.000 --> 12:56.500
<b>This is a world full of curses!</b>

13:00.170 --> 13:00.960
<b>What?!</b>

13:01.960 --> 13:06.040
<b>You've got a nice Shuuki of your own.
But say goodbye!</b>

13:18.210 --> 13:19.750
<b>This isn't a Shuuki.</b>

13:20.290 --> 13:21.500
<b>You're...</b>

13:35.710 --> 13:38.250
<b>Friggin' cowards!
Don't run away from me!</b>

13:38.500 --> 13:39.750
<b>Miss Kyouka!</b>

13:40.170 --> 13:41.210
<b>Fine then!</b>

13:41.210 --> 13:44.420
<b>I'll do exactly what you did
to all those fleeing villagers!</b>

13:44.420 --> 13:46.540
<b>And tear you apart from behind!</b>

13:46.540 --> 13:47.380
<b>YUUKI!</b>

13:47.830 --> 13:49.290
<b>What are you doing, Yuuki?!</b>

13:49.290 --> 13:50.330
<b>They're gettin-</b>

13:53.880 --> 13:55.500
<b>You okay, Shushu?</b>

13:55.500 --> 13:56.710
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

14:02.380 --> 14:03.580
<b>Yuuki!</b>

14:04.960 --> 14:07.080
<b>Himari and Shushu's safety
is our top priority.</b>

14:07.080 --> 14:08.460
<b>We're pulling back now!</b>

14:08.460 --> 14:09.500
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

14:10.420 --> 14:12.540
<b>What was I thinking?!</b>

14:13.040 --> 14:17.670
<b>I let my rage take over.
And it almost cost me my squadmates.</b>

14:25.790 --> 14:28.170
<b>Fortunately, their wounds
are relatively light.</b>

14:28.170 --> 14:29.670
<b>They'll be fully recovered by tomorrow.</b>

14:29.670 --> 14:31.290
<b>That's great news...</b>

14:34.500 --> 14:36.130
<b>Anyways,</b>

14:36.500 --> 14:39.580
<b>I can't believe the kind of filthy rewards
that come out of your subconscious.</b>

14:41.630 --> 14:44.670
<b>Seriously, this is just disgusting.
You perv.</b>

14:45.040 --> 14:46.500
<b>I feel you.</b>

14:46.500 --> 14:49.500
<b>The demands of my inner psyche
are starting to terrify even me!</b>

14:51.460 --> 14:53.170
<b>In regards to that last battle,</b>

14:53.170 --> 14:56.080
<b>I have a lot of questions and comments
to go over with you.</b>

14:56.330 --> 14:57.130
<b>For starters-</b>

14:57.130 --> 14:59.330
<b>I have something to report to you, too!</b>

14:59.330 --> 15:00.960
<b>But does it have to be
while we're like this?!</b>

15:01.670 --> 15:03.500
<b>I don't want to waste time.</b>

15:03.920 --> 15:06.920
<b>And this "reward" of yours
isn't going to end soon.</b>

15:06.920 --> 15:09.880
<b>I'm sorry that the Unihorn got away.</b>

15:09.880 --> 15:12.380
<b>Shushu and Himari's lives
were more important.</b>

15:12.960 --> 15:14.830
<b>I appreciate what you did.</b>

15:16.540 --> 15:19.290
<b>Well, you have an interesting way
of showing it!</b>

15:19.290 --> 15:20.250
<b>As if!</b>

15:20.500 --> 15:24.080
<b>This is something that you
subconsciously ASKED for, dammit!</b>

15:30.130 --> 15:31.710
<b>So, back to the Unihorn.</b>

15:31.710 --> 15:35.960
<b>That humanoid riding on top of it
must be some new species of Shuuki.</b>

15:36.290 --> 15:39.040
<b>It's crazy to think that a Shuuki
could speak our language.</b>

15:39.330 --> 15:41.670
<b>This news is going to shock
the entire country.</b>

15:42.960 --> 15:45.880
<b>Well, about that new species...</b>

15:45.880 --> 15:49.080
<b>Remember how I told you my big sister
went missing in a Mato Mishap?</b>

15:49.630 --> 15:51.960
<b>I think that thing
kind of resembled her...</b>

15:51.960 --> 15:54.080
<b>You're saying it might be your sister?</b>

15:54.080 --> 15:58.040
<b>Yeah. It's just a feeling I had.</b>

15:58.380 --> 16:02.460
<b>But also, it had a strange reaction
when it saw my face.</b>

16:04.670 --> 16:07.630
<b>Well, it did say something about
searching for a "little brother."</b>

16:07.630 --> 16:11.580
<b>I'm betting that word just triggered
memories of your sister.</b>

16:15.290 --> 16:17.290
<b>Besides, it told us that its brother</b>

16:17.290 --> 16:19.790
<b>is supposed to be
"the most handsome man ever."</b>

16:21.750 --> 16:22.920
<b>Yeah, true.</b>

16:22.920 --> 16:26.130
<b>That doesn't describe me at all...</b>

16:27.040 --> 16:30.210
<b>In any case, no ordinary human
could be that strong.</b>

16:30.210 --> 16:34.920
<b>Plus, nobody has ever heard of
a human becoming a Shuuki.</b>

16:37.380 --> 16:40.080
<b>We're bound to cross paths again.</b>

16:40.080 --> 16:43.080
<b>Because we won't stop looking
until we find them.</b>

16:43.080 --> 16:44.080
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

16:44.960 --> 16:48.540
<b>It's weird how happy you seem
about getting stepped on.</b>

16:48.880 --> 16:51.130
<b>I mean, the view IS nice from down here.</b>

16:52.580 --> 16:54.540
<b>You goddamn perv!</b>

16:54.830 --> 16:56.630
<b>Miss Kyouka? No, wait!</b>

17:00.460 --> 17:04.290
<b>Miss Kyouka seemed convinced that
it was a humanoid species of Shuuki.</b>

17:04.580 --> 17:06.460
<b>But if it really was my sister,</b>

17:06.460 --> 17:09.290
<b>why would she be attacking
the Demon Defense Forces?</b>

17:09.290 --> 17:11.380
<b>How has she stayed alive until now?</b>

17:11.830 --> 17:14.540
<b>And why is she working
with that horned monstrosity?</b>

17:14.920 --> 17:15.580
<b>If we see them again, what should I...?</b>

17:15.580 --> 17:16.580
<b>...ki!
</b><b>If we see them again, what should I...?</b><b></b>

17:16.580 --> 17:17.580
<b>Mr. Yuuki!
</b><b>If we see them again, what should I...?</b><b></b>

17:17.580 --> 17:18.670
<b>Mr. Yuuki!</b>

17:18.670 --> 17:20.670
<b>That pot is about to boil over!</b>

17:21.790 --> 17:23.420
<b>Sorry! I was spacing out!</b>

17:24.460 --> 17:25.750
<b>Kneel down here, please.</b>

17:25.750 --> 17:28.960
<b>Nei needs to take care of some business
as your senpai.</b>

17:29.830 --> 17:31.540
<b>What does that mean?</b>

17:32.130 --> 17:34.630
<b>Anybody who exposes the squad to danger
must be punished!</b>

17:34.630 --> 17:36.080
<b>Senpai Punch!</b>

17:36.080 --> 17:37.540
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

17:38.920 --> 17:40.040
<b>You had a big day,</b>

17:40.040 --> 17:44.960
<b>going out there to fight tough enemies
and save Shushu from danger.</b>

17:44.960 --> 17:46.750
<b>So I know that you're tired.</b>

17:46.750 --> 17:48.500
<b>I'm not the best cook,</b>

17:48.500 --> 17:50.960
<b>but I can make simple meals,
so would you like me to handle dinner?</b>

17:51.710 --> 17:53.000
<b>Wow, thanks!</b>

17:53.670 --> 17:55.880
<b>It's all part of being a good senpai!</b>

17:55.880 --> 17:58.540
<b>But that's okay. I'm good to cook.</b>

17:59.380 --> 18:01.580
<b>I almost don't deserve
such an amazing senpai!</b>

18:01.580 --> 18:02.500
<b>Thank you.</b>

18:05.540 --> 18:06.460
<b>Alright!</b>

18:06.460 --> 18:09.500
<b>Would you mind helping
to plate all the food?</b>

18:09.920 --> 18:11.710
<b>Just leave it to me!</b>

18:12.040 --> 18:15.670
<b>I can figure out whether or not
she's my sister the next time we meet.</b>

18:15.920 --> 18:18.040
<b>For now, gotta focus on work!</b>

18:19.330 --> 18:22.130
<b>Crawling back here with injuries? Really?</b>

18:22.500 --> 18:25.580
<b>I thought that you were above
such disgraces...</b>

18:25.750 --> 18:26.960
<b>Aoba.</b>

18:27.540 --> 18:30.790
<b>What can I say? I got taken by surprise.</b>

18:32.170 --> 18:33.750
<b>There! All better!</b>

18:34.170 --> 18:35.630
<b>Perfect!</b>

18:36.380 --> 18:38.080
<b>Thank you, Coco!</b>

18:41.540 --> 18:44.250
<b>That was Yuuki, I'm sure of it.</b>

18:45.630 --> 18:48.380
<b>But I dunno how he ended up
looking like a Shuuki.</b>

18:48.750 --> 18:50.170
<b>An experiment by the Demon Defense Force?</b>

18:50.170 --> 18:52.580
<b>Or the ability of that woman
riding on top of him?</b>

18:53.080 --> 18:56.000
<b>When did they start letting guys into
the Demon Defense Force, anyways?</b>

18:56.960 --> 18:59.330
<b>But it was a nice reunion.</b>

18:59.330 --> 19:00.790
<b>Right, Yuuki?</b>

19:01.460 --> 19:04.290
<b>The Unihorn was crazy powerful.</b>

19:05.710 --> 19:06.880
<b>If we fight again-</b>

19:06.880 --> 19:08.830
<b>What's eating at you, my little slave?</b>

19:08.830 --> 19:10.250
<b>Whoa! Shushu?!</b>

19:10.750 --> 19:12.290
<b>You're already back in action?</b>

19:12.290 --> 19:13.630
<b>Yep! I'm in tip-top shape!</b>

19:13.830 --> 19:16.750
<b>Thanks for saving my butt
when I was in big trouble.</b>

19:16.750 --> 19:18.960
<b>Of course, don't mention it.</b>

19:22.250 --> 19:23.960
<b>Let me return the favor...</b>

19:24.380 --> 19:25.920
<b>with a nice back scrub!</b>

19:25.920 --> 19:27.920
<b>Hey! Enough with the jokes!</b>

19:27.920 --> 19:30.920
<b>Oh! You sure you wanna turn around?</b>

19:30.920 --> 19:33.040
<b>I'm totally naked back here, ya know.</b>

19:34.380 --> 19:37.380
<b>So just shut up and let me wash your back.</b>

19:40.330 --> 19:43.290
<b>Okay, bossman, here we go.</b>

19:44.790 --> 19:47.040
<b>Is she actually naked?</b>

19:47.040 --> 19:49.500
<b>Well, I can't risk turning around
if that's true.</b>

19:49.500 --> 19:51.540
<b>Shushu's pulling this
little prank in the belief</b>

19:51.540 --> 19:53.500
<b>that I'm NOT the type of guy
who'd turn around!</b>

19:53.500 --> 19:56.250
<b>Or maybe that's just what
she WANTS me to think!</b>

19:56.250 --> 19:58.880
<b>I hear that most people
are prone to playing it safe.</b>

19:58.880 --> 20:00.500
<b>So confidently turning around</b>

20:00.500 --> 20:03.290
<b>and saying "I knew you had a swimsuit on!
Now get out of here!"</b>

20:03.290 --> 20:06.790
<b>would be the smart move
in order to teach her a lesson!</b>

20:07.460 --> 20:08.540
<b>Here goes!</b>

20:08.540 --> 20:10.290
<b>Too bad, Shushu,
but I wasn't born yesterda-</b>

20:14.920 --> 20:17.880
<b>What the eff?! You were actually naked?!</b>

20:18.630 --> 20:20.880
<b>Yuuki just got an eyeful of me...</b>

20:20.880 --> 20:22.920
<b>And now my heart is racing!</b>

20:32.750 --> 20:35.420
<b>Guess you're ready to
finally have it twisted off, huh?!</b>

20:36.790 --> 20:39.250
<b>Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Hold up! Hold up!</b>

20:40.920 --> 20:43.580
<b>I put up a sign that said
"bath occupied," didn't I?!</b>

20:43.580 --> 20:46.630
<b>Then you should've made it more clear...</b>

20:46.630 --> 20:50.080
<b>that it was A GUY IN THE BATH!</b>

20:57.630 --> 20:58.830
<b>Hello there.</b>

21:01.420 --> 21:03.540
<b>Never a dull moment
with the 7th Squad, huh?</b>

21:04.380 --> 21:05.670
<b>Intruder alert!</b>

21:05.670 --> 21:07.670
<b>These two are members
of the 6th Squad.</b>

21:07.670 --> 21:08.540
<b>Huh?</b>

21:09.040 --> 21:11.830
<b>I'm the commander of the 6th Squad.
Tenka Izumo.</b>

21:11.830 --> 21:13.790
<b>TENKA IZUMO</b>

21:15.880 --> 21:18.580
<b>And I'm her second-in-command.
Yachiho Azuma.</b>

21:18.580 --> 21:20.500
<b>YACHIHO AZUMA</b>

21:20.750 --> 21:21.750
<b>Azuma?</b>

21:24.170 --> 21:26.750
<b>So you're the slave
I've heard so much about...</b>

21:29.920 --> 21:31.000
<b>Anyways,</b>

21:31.000 --> 21:32.580
<b>could you fetch Kyo for me?</b>

21:32.580 --> 21:34.040
<b>Y-you mean Miss Kyouka?</b>

21:34.500 --> 21:36.040
<b>Sure! Right away!</b>

23:11.000 --> 23:13.710
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.210 --> 23:13.000
<b>"Teach Us! Nei-senpai!"</b>

23:13.000 --> 23:13.710
<b>Okey-dokey!</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:16.290
<b>Today we're talking
about my Peach ability.</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:18.210
<b>SURE TO FIND: PROMISE</b>

23:16.290 --> 23:17.920
<b>It's called "Sure To Find: Promise."</b>

23:17.920 --> 23:19.080
<b>Otherwise known as clairvoyance,</b>

23:19.080 --> 23:20.960
<b>this ability gives me the power
to see places far away,</b>

23:20.960 --> 23:23.880
<b>which I use to determine the locations of
Shuuki and victims of Mato Mishaps.</b>

23:24.000 --> 23:26.920
<b>I can also use it to share the POV of
a person who has touched me before,</b>

23:26.920 --> 23:28.960
<b>so it's an ability highly valued
by scouting teams!</b>

23:28.960 --> 23:31.790
<b>There are some places where my powers
can't observe, such as inside caves,</b>

23:31.790 --> 23:33.290
<b>and it's pretty useless in combat.</b>

23:33.290 --> 23:36.250
<b>But I believe that I have my own role
to play and always give it my very best!</b>

23:36.250 --> 23:37.460
<b>Anyways, next time:</b>

23:37.460 --> 23:39.040
<b>"Whirlwind, Himari, Roar"</b>

23:37.460 --> 23:40.960
<b>WHIRLWIND,</b>

23:37.460 --> 23:40.960
<b>HIMARI,</b>

23:37.460 --> 23:40.960
<b>ROAR</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:40.460
<b>Thanks for watching!</b>
